# Aivido release byte-parity: canonical UI and release tooling are LF-pinned.
# Every checkout (Windows autocrlf or not, macOS, Linux) yields identical
# bytes, so FRESH INSTALL HASH == APPROVED UI HASH holds on every platform.
ui/** text eol=lf
scripts/*.py text eol=lf
config/*.json text eol=lf
tests/*.py text eol=lf